{"units": [{"i": 0, "p": 0, "t0": 0.0, "t1": 1.84, "text": "Coba semprotkan deodoran ke tanganmu.", "v0": 3.0, "v1": 4.84}, {"i": 1, "p": 0, "t0": 2.57, "t1": 3.5, "text": "Rasanya dingin.", "v0": 5.57, "v1": 6.5}, {"i": 2, "p": 0, "t0": 4.0, "t1": 5.84, "text": "Sekarang pompa ban sepeda dengan cepat.", "v0": 7.0, "v1": 8.84}, {"i": 3, "p": 0, "t0": 6.33, "t1": 7.76, "text": "Ujung pompanya terasa hangat.", "v0": 9.33, "v1": 10.76}, {"i": 4, "p": 0, "t0": 8.27, "t1": 11.34, "text": "Tidak ada es dan tidak ada api, tetapi suhunya berubah.", "v0": 11.27, "v1": 14.34}, {"i": 5, "p": 0, "t0": 11.86, "t1": 14.03, "text": "Rahasianya ada pada mengembang dan memampat.", "v0": 14.86, "v1": 17.03}, {"i": 6, "p": 1, "t0": 14.54, "t1": 16.25, "text": "Udara yang mengembang akan mendingin.", "v0": 17.54, "v1": 19.25}, {"i": 7, "p": 1, "t0": 16.58, "t1": 18.54, "text": "Udara yang dimampatkan akan memanas.", "v0": 19.58, "v1": 21.54}, {"i": 8, "p": 1, "t0": 19.16, "t1": 22.39, "text": "Dan inilah yang terjadi pada Si Gumpal setiap kali ia naik.", "v0": 22.16, "v1": 25.39}, {"i": 9, "p": 2, "t0": 22.84, "t1": 26.0, "text": "Ingat, makin tinggi, tekanan udara makin rendah.", "v0": 25.84, "v1": 29.0}, {"i": 10, "p": 2, "t0": 26.47, "t1": 31.28, "text": "Saat Si Gumpal naik, udara di sekitarnya makin renggang, sehingga Si Gumpal mengembang.", "v0": 29.47, "v1": 34.28}, {"i": 11, "p": 2, "t0": 31.49, "t1": 35.78, "text": "Karena mengembang, ia mendingin, tanpa ada panas yang keluar atau masuk.", "v0": 34.49, "v1": 38.78}, {"i": 12, "p": 2, "t0": 36.44, "t1": 41.5, "text": "Perubahan suhu seperti ini disebut proses adiabatik, atau adiabatic process.", "v0": 39.44, "v1": 44.5}, {"i": 13, "p": 3, "t0": 42.19, "t1": 47.34, "text": "Selama Si Gumpal belum jenuh, ia mendingin sekitar satu derajat setiap naik seratus meter.", "v0": 45.19, "v1": 50.34}, {"i": 14, "p": 3, "t0": 48.02, "t1": 52.2, "text": "Ini disebut laju adiabatik kering, atau dry adiabatic lapse rate.", "v0": 51.02, "v1": 55.2}, {"i": 15, "p": 4, "t0": 52.85, "t1": 54.83, "text": "Si Gumpal terus naik dan terus mendingin.", "v0": 55.85, "v1": 57.83}, {"i": 16, "p": 4, "t0": 55.44, "t1": 57.73, "text": "Suatu saat suhunya sampai di titik embun.", "v0": 58.44, "v1": 60.73}, {"i": 17, "p": 4, "t0": 58.14, "t1": 58.85, "text": "Gelasnya penuh.", "v0": 61.14, "v1": 61.85}, {"i": 18, "p": 4, "t0": 59.38, "t1": 62.69, "text": "Uap air mulai mengembun, dan Si Gumpal menjadi awan.", "v0": 62.38, "v1": 65.69}, {"i": 19, "p": 4, "t0": 62.94, "t1": 69.09, "text": "Ketinggian tempat awan mulai terbentuk disebut lifting condensation level, yaitu ketinggian dasar awan.", "v0": 65.94, "v1": 72.09}, {"i": 20, "p": 5, "t0": 69.75, "t1": 71.19, "text": "Ada cara cepat menaksirnya:", "v0": 72.75, "v1": 74.19}, {"i": 21, "p": 5, "t0": 71.47, "t1": 77.23, "text": "seratus dua puluh lima dikali selisih suhu udara dan titik embun di permukaan, hasilnya dalam meter.", "v0": 74.47, "v1": 80.23}, {"i": 22, "p": 5, "t0": 77.83, "t1": 82.32, "text": "Misalnya suhu udara tiga puluh derajat dan titik embunnya dua puluh dua.", "v0": 80.83, "v1": 85.32}, {"i": 23, "p": 5, "t0": 82.74, "t1": 83.86, "text": "Selisihnya delapan.", "v0": 85.74, "v1": 86.86}, {"i": 24, "p": 5, "t0": 84.4, "t1": 87.69, "text": "Delapan dikali seratus dua puluh lima, yaitu seribu meter.", "v0": 87.4, "v1": 90.69}, {"i": 25, "p": 5, "t0": 88.32, "t1": 91.05, "text": "Dasar awan ada di ketinggian sekitar satu kilometer.", "v0": 91.32, "v1": 94.05}, {"i": 26, "p": 6, "t0": 91.24, "t1": 100.44, "text": "Setelah jenuh, Si Gumpal tetap naik dan tetap mendingin, tetapi lebih lambat, hanya sekitar nol koma lima sampai nol koma enam derajat per seratus meter.", "v0": 94.24, "v1": 103.44}, {"i": 27, "p": 6, "t0": 101.1, "t1": 105.8, "text": "Ini disebut laju adiabatik basah, atau saturated adiabatic lapse rate.", "v0": 104.1, "v1": 108.8}, {"i": 28, "p": 6, "t0": 106.36, "t1": 107.34, "text": "Kenapa lebih lambat?", "v0": 109.36, "v1": 110.34}, {"i": 29, "p": 6, "t0": 107.96, "t1": 111.51, "text": "Karena saat uap air mengembun, ia melepaskan panas laten.", "v0": 110.96, "v1": 114.51}, {"i": 30, "p": 6, "t0": 112.21, "t1": 115.5, "text": "Panas ini seperti penghangat kecil yang mengurangi pendinginan.", "v0": 115.21, "v1": 118.5}, {"i": 31, "p": 7, "t0": 116.17, "t1": 117.62, "text": "Sekarang pertanyaan pentingnya:", "v0": 119.17, "v1": 120.62}, {"i": 32, "p": 7, "t0": 118.17, "t1": 122.11, "text": "apakah Si Gumpal akan terus naik, atau turun lagi?", "v0": 121.17, "v1": 125.11}, {"i": 33, "p": 8, "t0": 122.45, "t1": 125.28, "text": "Jawabannya, bandingkan Si Gumpal dengan udara di sekitarnya.", "v0": 125.45, "v1": 128.28}, {"i": 34, "p": 8, "t0": 125.94, "t1": 132.5, "text": "Kalau Si Gumpal lebih hangat daripada sekitarnya, ia lebih ringan dan terus naik, seperti balon udara panas.", "v0": 128.94, "v1": 135.5}, {"i": 35, "p": 8, "t0": 133.14, "t1": 136.03, "text": "Kalau lebih dingin, ia lebih berat dan turun kembali.", "v0": 136.14, "v1": 139.03}, {"i": 36, "p": 9, "t0": 136.7, "t1": 137.85, "text": "Bayangkan sebuah bola.", "v0": 139.7, "v1": 140.85}, {"i": 37, "p": 9, "t0": 138.4, "t1": 141.9, "text": "Bola di dasar mangkuk, kalau didorong, akan kembali ke tengah.", "v0": 141.4, "v1": 144.9}, {"i": 38, "p": 9, "t0": 142.48, "t1": 143.25, "text": "Itu stabil.", "v0": 145.48, "v1": 146.25}, {"i": 39, "p": 9, "t0": 143.76, "t1": 147.93, "text": "Bola di puncak bukit, sedikit didorong saja langsung menggelinding jauh.", "v0": 146.76, "v1": 150.93}, {"i": 40, "p": 9, "t0": 148.33, "t1": 148.96, "text": "Itu labil.", "v0": 151.33, "v1": 151.96}, {"i": 41, "p": 10, "t0": 149.35, "t1": 150.71, "text": "Atmosfer juga begitu.", "v0": 152.35, "v1": 153.71}, {"i": 42, "p": 10, "t0": 150.92, "t1": 160.29, "text": "Kalau suhu lingkungan turun cepat ke atas, lebih cepat dari laju adiabatik, Si Gumpal selalu lebih hangat dari sekitarnya dan terus naik.", "v0": 153.92, "v1": 163.29}, {"i": 43, "p": 10, "t0": 160.52, "t1": 162.78, "text": "Atmosfer labil, atau unstable.", "v0": 163.52, "v1": 165.78}, {"i": 44, "p": 10, "t0": 163.11, "t1": 166.4, "text": "Hasilnya awan kumulonimbus yang menjulang dan badai petir.", "v0": 166.11, "v1": 169.4}, {"i": 45, "p": 10, "t0": 167.07, "t1": 171.53, "text": "Kalau suhu lingkungan turun lambat, Si Gumpal cepat menjadi lebih dingin dan turun lagi.", "v0": 170.07, "v1": 174.53}, {"i": 46, "p": 10, "t0": 172.09, "t1": 174.06, "text": "Atmosfer stabil, atau stable.", "v0": 175.09, "v1": 177.06}, {"i": 47, "p": 10, "t0": 174.61, "t1": 176.24, "text": "Cuaca cerah atau berkabut.", "v0": 177.61, "v1": 179.24}, {"i": 48, "p": 11, "t0": 176.53, "t1": 181.22, "text": "Di antara keduanya ada kondisi labil bersyarat, atau conditionally unstable:", "v0": 179.53, "v1": 184.22}, {"i": 49, "p": 11, "t0": 181.58, "t1": 185.78, "text": "stabil saat udara masih kering, tetapi menjadi labil setelah udara jenuh.", "v0": 184.58, "v1": 188.78}, {"i": 50, "p": 12, "t0": 186.51, "t1": 188.45, "text": "Sekarang, coba kerjakan soal ini.", "v0": 189.51, "v1": 191.45}, {"i": 51, "p": 13, "t0": 189.06, "t1": 195.88, "text": "Selisih suhu udara dan titik embun adalah tiga puluh satu dikurangi dua puluh tiga, yaitu delapan derajat.", "v0": 196.06, "v1": 202.88}, {"i": 52, "p": 13, "t0": 196.59, "t1": 200.34, "text": "Delapan dikali seratus dua puluh lima sama dengan seribu meter.", "v0": 203.59, "v1": 207.34}, {"i": 53, "p": 13, "t0": 201.05, "t1": 202.21, "text": "Jawabannya C.", "v0": 208.05, "v1": 209.21}, {"i": 54, "p": 14, "t0": 202.89, "t1": 203.92, "text": "Ada dua jebakan.", "v0": 209.89, "v1": 210.92}, {"i": 55, "p": 14, "t0": 204.39, "t1": 211.24, "text": "Pertama, laju basah lebih kecil karena pelepasan panas laten, bukan karena udara jenuh lebih berat.", "v0": 211.39, "v1": 218.24}, {"i": 56, "p": 14, "t0": 211.72, "t1": 215.24, "text": "Kedua, atmosfer stabil justru membuat cuaca tenang, bukan badai.", "v0": 218.72, "v1": 222.24}, {"i": 57, "p": 15, "t0": 215.94, "t1": 216.56, "text": "Ringkasnya:", "v0": 222.94, "v1": 223.56}, {"i": 58, "p": 15, "t0": 216.79, "t1": 224.19, "text": "udara yang naik mengembang dan mendingin, satu derajat per seratus meter saat kering dan sekitar nol koma enam saat jenuh.", "v0": 223.79, "v1": 231.19}, {"i": 59, "p": 15, "t0": 224.89, "t1": 228.42, "text": "Atmosfer labil membuat udara terus naik dan membentuk badai.", "v0": 231.89, "v1": 235.42}, {"i": 60, "p": 15, "t0": 229.14, "t1": 231.75, "text": "Berikutnya, kita bawa Si Gumpal melewati gunung:", "v0": 236.14, "v1": 238.75}, {"i": 61, "p": 15, "t0": 232.28, "t1": 232.99, "text": "efek fohn.", "v0": 239.28, "v1": 239.99}, {"i": 62, "p": 15, "t0": 233.68, "t1": 237.55, "text": "Latihan soalnya ada di O S N Geo titik I D.", "v0": 240.68, "v1": 244.55}], "words": [{"w": "Coba", "t": 3.0, "u": 0}, {"w": "semprotkan", "t": 3.28, "u": 0}, {"w": "deodoran", "t": 3.71, "u": 0}, {"w": "ke", "t": 4.27, "u": 0}, {"w": "tanganmu.", "t": 4.42, "u": 0}, {"w": "Rasanya", "t": 5.57, "u": 1}, {"w": "dingin.", "t": 6.13, "u": 1}, {"w": "Sekarang", "t": 7.0, "u": 2}, {"w": "pompa", "t": 7.42, "u": 2}, {"w": "ban", "t": 7.71, "u": 2}, {"w": "sepeda", "t": 7.85, "u": 2}, {"w": "dengan", "t": 8.27, "u": 2}, {"w": "cepat.", "t": 8.56, "u": 2}, {"w": "Ujung", "t": 9.33, "u": 3}, {"w": "pompanya", "t": 9.62, "u": 3}, {"w": "terasa", "t": 10.04, "u": 3}, {"w": "hangat.", "t": 10.47, "u": 3}, {"w": "Tidak", "t": 11.27, "u": 4}, {"w": "ada", "t": 11.58, "u": 4}, {"w": "es", "t": 11.89, "u": 4}, {"w": "dan", "t": 12.04, "u": 4}, {"w": "tidak", "t": 12.2, "u": 4}, {"w": "ada", "t": 12.51, "u": 4}, {"w": "api,", "t": 12.82, "u": 4}, {"w": "tetapi", "t": 13.13, "u": 4}, {"w": "suhunya", "t": 13.53, "u": 4}, {"w": "berubah.", "t": 13.94, "u": 4}, {"w": "Rahasianya", "t": 14.86, "u": 5}, {"w": "ada", "t": 15.54, "u": 5}, {"w": "pada", "t": 15.81, "u": 5}, {"w": "mengembang", "t": 16.08, "u": 5}, {"w": "dan", "t": 16.49, "u": 5}, {"w": "memampat.", "t": 16.62, "u": 5}, {"w